mary--dark-green"><span class="m-modal__content--close-button">Close <i class="icon icon-x"></i></span></button></span></div><div class="m-modal__content--contents"><div class="m-map"><div data-testid="map" style="width:100%;height:100%;position:relative;z-index:0"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="m-help-card m-help-card--dark"><div class="m-help-card__heading"><h4>All Saints Community Centre</h4></div><div class="m-help-card__description"><div class="a-rich-text">Part of Medway Foodbank</div></div><div class="m-help-card__phone"><div class="m-help-card__phone-number-mobile"><span class=""><a href="tel:01634 757057" class="a-button a-button__primary a-button__primary--trussell-green" aria-label="01634 757057">01634 757057</a></span></div><div class="m-help-card__phone-number">01634 757057</div><div class="m-help-card__phone-details">Please note that the office and telephones are manned as follows : Mondays : Closed Tuesdays : 9.30am - 3.00pm Wednesdays : 9.30am - 3.00pm Thursdays : 9.30am - 3.00pm Fridays : 9.30am – 1.30pm We are fully closed during all holiday periods.</div></div><div class="m-help-card__email"><a href="mailto:info@medway.foodbank.org.uk" class="m-help-card__email-address">info@medway.foodbank.org.uk</a><div class="m-help-card__email-details"></div></div><div class="m-help-card__icon-container"><div class="m-help-card__icon-container--icon"></div><div class="m-help-card__icon-container--content"><div class="m-help-card__address"><div>The Magpie Centre</div><div>33 Magpie Hall Road</div><div>Chatham, Kent</div><div>ME4 5NE</div></div><div class="m-help-card__directions-link"><a class="m-help-card__external-link" aria-label="directions link" href="https://www.google.com/maps?saddr=My+Location&amp;daddr=ME4%205NE" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><h6>Get directions</h6></a></div><div><div class="m-help-card__icon-and-text-wrapper">Collection only</div></div></div></div><div class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-container" data-theme="dark"><h6>Collection times</h6><div class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-today"><p class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-today-text">Closed today</p></div><ul class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-list"><li class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-item"><span class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-day">Monday</span><ul class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-hours-list"><li class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-hours-item">10:00 am to 12:30 pm</li></ul></li><li class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-item"><span class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-day">Tuesday-Thursday</span><span class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-hours-item">Closed</span></li><li class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-item"><span class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-day">Friday</span><ul class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-hours-list"><li class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-hours-item">10:00 am to 12:30 pm</li></ul></li><li class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-item"><span class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-day">Saturday-Sunday</span><span class="a-redeem-voucher-opening-times__opening-times-hours-item">Closed</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="m-help-card m-help-card--dark"><div class="m-help-card__heading"><h4>MidKent College</h4></div><div class="m-help-card__description"><div class="a-rich-text">Part of Medway Foodbank</div></div><div class="m-help-card__phone"><div class="m-help-card__phone-number-mobile"><span class=""><a href="tel:01634 757057" class="a-button a-button__primary a-button__primary--trussell-green" aria-label="01634 757057">01634 757057</a></span></div><div class="m-help-card__phone-number">01634 757057</div><div class="m-help-card__phone-details">Please note that the office and tel